  "confirmedFindings": [
    {
      "id": "unknown-commit-publish-callers",
      "status": "author_confirmed_fix_in_progress_after_immutable_v1",
      "file": "Modules/Services/SelfRenewal/SelfRenewalAppSession.swift",
      "trigger": "writeDocument performs rename then fsync(directory) fails during bootstrap/observe/unavailable publish, not configure.",
      "result": "Only configure catch sets configurationNeedsReload and discards coordinator/vault. Other publish paths keep previous active bindings and can bypass held-flock resync/reload on next bootstrap, contrary to the frozen configurationContract.",
      "requiredCorrection": "Handle commitDurabilityUnknown in the single publish write boundary, discard active bindings and mark reload for every caller while preserving the original error. Do not edit frozen-v1 history."
    }
  ],
  "reviewedNoAdditionalConfirmedBlocker": [
    "App @State supplies one SelfRenewalAppOwner; AppDependencies injects that owner and its identical handoff into existing settings/reader DI. Neither DI nor view creates a fallback owner.",
    "MainActor observable guard and actor session busy guard both span awaits; close cannot release a live journal below another operation. Startup binds actual existing book/source/position owners and invokes only local/bootstrap observation, not network recovery or install.",
    "A newly opened Journal obtains its existing flock before configuration load or fixed pending reclamation. Failed configuration load closes the newly acquired journal and preserves independent close error.",
    "Existing transaction namespace/trust and material-generation/peer checks are not rebound silently. Missing materials retain the journal; local retirement only uses existing sealed Journal APIs; remote/unknown phases are not guessed safe.",
    "Public configuration read is bounded via O_NOFOLLOW regular one-link FD; write is exclusive fixed pending, checked file fsync/close, rename and directory fsync. Directory-sync unknown handling has the confirmed caller gap above.",
    "Only explicit recovery starts pinned pairing/coordinator.recover, without upload/Upgrade. Current expired/unavailable Bundle/profile/vault still prevents constructing recovery; that Lookup-only gap is correctly recorded unfinished.",
    "New UI uses existing themed sections/rows/footer, explicit config import and recovery; automatic renewal/Apple authority/cold launch/all-user-data claims remain false. New23-key sets match five locales and preserve canonical prefixes byte-for-byte."
  ],
